 "pg.9fe42fd809": "SetuHQ reads public CHEOPS light curves (the Data Reduction Pipeline's photometry) through DACE, the University of Geneva's public API in front of the CHEOPS Mission Archive; ESA does not designate DACE. Only visits the archive marks as public are read, with no credentials, and no raw CHEOPS file is stored in this repository or shipped in the package. The CHEOPS capability is <b>not validated</b>: its null and injection gates failed, so two comparisons are inconclusive, and the end-to-end match with pycheops' product failed. The CHEOPS-derived numbers are not on this page: they are in <a rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://github.com/ashfordeOU/SetuHQ/blob/main/docs/results/stellar_validation_cheops.md\">stellar_validation_cheops.md</a>, under ESA's terms.",
